{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03937","headline":"饯许州宋司马赴任 · 李适","name":"饯许州宋司马赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔吾游箕山，朅来涉颍水。\n复有许由庙，迢迢白云里。\n闻君佐繁昌，临风怅怀此。\n傥到平舆泉，寄谢干将里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}